      <h1
        class="mb-4 font-sans text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,2.75rem)] font-light leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-ink"
      >
        I'm <span
          class="font-display font-semibold text-[clamp(2.25rem,5.5vw,3rem)]"
          >Oluwakayode.</span
        >
      </h1>

      <p
        class="mb-7 max-w-[440px] max-[500px]:max-w-full text-[0.9rem] leading-[1.75] text-muted"
      >
        I build full-stack web applications with a strong focus on server logic
        and databases. I love figuring out complex systems to build cool,
        interesting solutions, and I write technical articles to share what I
        learn along the way. Currently sharpening my craft and looking for a
        full-time role.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a
